<!doctype html><html><head><title>Agency publishes heat pump efficiency standard</title></head>
<body><main>
<p>The Example Agency published a new efficiency standard for heat pumps on November 11, 2026. The standard sets a minimum seasonal rating for units sold after July 1, 2027.</p>
<p>Manufacturers have 18 months to label existing models. The agency said the standard follows a public comment period that drew 312 submissions from installers, utilities and households.</p>
</main></body></html>
